title: 'Classroom MVP — first real build: gate bootstrapped, /forage skill, /class THE STAND'
summary: Began building the Academy for real (zero engine changes, per the MVP plan). (1) Bootstrapped the gate on this repo — recorded SC-aspect-validate-vs-queryable (the double-tilde lesson we lived this session) + SY-compliance syllabus v1, so .paradigm/curriculum/ exists and /class is no longer a cold no-op. (2) Wrote the new /paradigm:forage skill — the Expeditions MVP (agents foraging the wild for cited external candidates, staged at trust:external, never certifying), encoding the ratified trust rules (TD-2026-06-25-044). (3) Upgraded /paradigm:class with Step 0 (the Orientation cold-start divert) + the review arm rebuilt as THE STAND (dissent-first turn order, @-interrogation, refine read-back, the no-one-could-break='untested' rule) + an External-candidates section (citation-first, no benefit-of-the-doubt, provisional ceiling) + the context-firewall hard rule.
