learnings:
  - 'The Classroom MVP genuinely needs zero engine changes: bootstrapping is two MCP calls (paradigm_scenario_record + paradigm_syllabus_record create .paradigm/curriculum/ and flip /class + /study-hall from no-op to live), and the rest is SKILL.md choreography. The plan''s ''bootstrap first'' sequencing is real — done in minutes.'
  - Plugin skills are auto-discovered by directory (plugins/paradigm/skills/<name>/SKILL.md) — no manifest enumeration; the plugin.json version bump is a release-time step, not needed for a local skill to work.
  - '/paradigm:forage is study-hall pointed outward: same staging machine (paradigm_journal_record), same ''stage-never-certify'' guarantee, but trust:''external'' + sourceSet + an intake evidence-gate (a breaking scenario against OUR repo or it stays in Field Notes) — the firewall that makes scraped opinion the most-scrutinized path, not a backdoor.'
